  "post_content": "<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13.33px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm;\"><font color=\"#000010\">(8 fotos) <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span lang=\"CA\" style=\"margin: 0px;\">L&#39;Ajuntament d&#39;Onda ha aprovat en el Ple celebrat la vesprada d&#39;aquest dimecres per unanimitat el Pla d&#39;Inclusi&oacute; i Cohesi&oacute; Social 2019/2022, emmarcat en el Pla Valenci&agrave; d&#39;Inclusi&oacute; i Cohesi&oacute; Social 2017/2022, amb l&#39;objectiu de ser una eina de planificaci&oacute;, ordenaci&oacute;, gesti&oacute; i direcci&oacute; estrat&egrave;gica de les mesures i accions d&#39;inclusi&oacute; i cohesi&oacute; social vinculades al municipi. </span></span></font></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pleajunondagener19/img_2710.jpg\" alt=\"img_2710\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pleajunondagener19/img_2713.jpg\" alt=\"img_2713\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pleajunondagener19/img_2715.jpg\" alt=\"img_2715\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pleajunondagener19/img_2716.jpg\" alt=\"img_2716\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pleajunondagener19/img_2717.jpg\" alt=\"img_2717\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pleajunondagener19/img_2723.jpg\" alt=\"img_2723\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pleajunondagener19/img_2724.jpg\" alt=\"img_2724\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pleajunondagener19/img_2729.jpg\" alt=\"img_2729\" style=\"max-width:10